	(text "VCC and VCC2 use 3.3 V. All returns use one board ground plane.\nVBATT follows the main rail; no separate backup-cell supply.\nAnalog references use AVCC0 / AVSS0. Place bypasses at named ball pairs.\nUSB/MIPI supplies remain on the interface sheet and are not yet wired.\nHUM Rev.1.30: Table 69.2 p.4042; unused references: section 21.4 pp.861-862.\nThis is an electrical draft; capacitor MPN qualification remains open."
		(at 147.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
